flowchart TD
  Source[Versioned Mermaid source] --> Render[Render with target version]
  Render --> Check{Readable at mobile content width?}
  Check -->|No| Refine[Shorten labels, regroup, or split]
  Refine --> Render
  Check -->|Yes| Export[Export PNG at 2x]
  Export --> Inspect[Inspect the actual image]
  Inspect --> Sync{Source and asset from same revision?}
  Sync -->|No| Render
  Sync -->|Yes| Ready([Ready for article draft])
